{"id":"vod_bf_44401","vodId":"44401","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"宇宙巡警露露子","name_cn":"宇宙巡警露露子","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-45/4678bb2c2124748b3cf314473405c9a8.jpg"},"summary":"《宇宙巡警露露子》是由今石洋之指导，TRIGGER五周年纪念的短篇原创电视动画作品。据称位于银河系中心的宇宙巡警本部。由那里所指定的，太阳系边境宇宙移民特区OGIKUBO。自移民开始后20年，宇宙偏差值最低的宇宙贫民街建成了。父亲是宇宙巡警的刑警，普通的女初中生露露子，某天为了救助突然遭到冻结的父亲而造访了宇宙巡警OGIKUBO支部，在那里被Over Justice本部长任命为宇宙巡警。在穿上机能略有改变的宇宙巡警套装后，露露子能否拯救父亲，从宇宙罪犯的魔手中守护OGIKUBO的和平，以及兼顾初中生本分的“恋爱”与“学业”呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:12:17","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yuzhouxunjingluluzi/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yuzhouxunjingluluzi/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yuzhouxunjingluluzi/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yuzhouxunjingluluzi/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yuzhouxunjingluluzi/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yuzhouxunjingluluzi/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yuzhouxunjingluluzi/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yuzhouxunjingluluzi/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yuzhouxunjingluluzi/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yuzhouxunjingluluzi/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yuzhouxunjingluluzi/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yuzhouxunjingluluzi/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yuzhouxunjingluluzi/第13集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T0